WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:05.172
So, how much do you really know 
about Snoopy?

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:08.175
There's a whole lot more to
this pup than meets the eye.

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:10.177
It's time to play...

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.471
First up...

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:13.889
do you know where Snoopy 
was born?

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:15.098
Was it?

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:20.020
Don't be nervous,
you're gonna like it here.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.824
The answer...

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:35.911
But, did you also know

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:38.080
he wasn't born alone.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.665
How many brothers and
sisters

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:41.667
do you think Snoopy has?

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.465
And the answer is...

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.676
Way to go!

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:54.721
Think you can name them all?

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.356
Oh, hey Snoopy.

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:05.983
Snoopy's got a lot of talents.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.609
Like dancing,

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.319
painting,

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:11.321
or going on incredible
adventures

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.783
But, can you guess his
other secret talent?

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:15.867
Is it?

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:17.930
Hey Kid!

00:01:18.226 --> 00:01:20.573
Can I have my badminton
racket back?

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:34.970
Magic? I'll believe it 
when I see it.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.596
If you guessed master magician

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.973
you're right.

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:40.976
He's one dog that can always
learn new tricks.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.688
And speaking of hidden
talents...

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:46.898
Here's a question for Charlie
Brown.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.025
That's me!

00:01:56.199 --> 00:01:58.410
Hey, can someone throw me the
ball?

00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:00.537
It's true!

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:02.539
You've got- Wow!

00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:07.252
I've given up two hits and
I haven't even thrown a pitch.

00:02:07.586 --> 00:02:10.464
Say, it looks like you already
knew a lot about Snoopy.

00:02:10.464 --> 00:02:13.717
But, there's always something
new to discover.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.969
Thanks for playing

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.971
The Snoopy Scoop.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:21.600
Only on Apple TV+

